{"ID":"20240522082252-nobzw5o","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082252-nobzw5o","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082252-nobzw5o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092012-vbx9l7i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092012-zzwkbhp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092012-ppqql15\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:13,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:17\u0026#125;","title":"化療以後的肝臟疼痛","type":"doc","updated":"20240522092410"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522092012-vbx9l7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-vbx9l7i","updated":"20240522092027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、【淋巴癌化療後肝區痛案例】 "}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-3d7opc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-3d7opc0","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎9-16-2008初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-ipskyu8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-ipskyu8","updated":"20240522092032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"A.W.C婦人， 61歲，B型肝炎病史，2007年9月發現淋巴癌，六次化療後，出現右脅下持續性尖銳刺痛，左脅間斷刺痛，肝功能指數、病毒數量飆高，四肢未稍麻痛，半夜2點必醒，須１小時後方能再入睡，並且自覺身熱煩燥，盜汗"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(肝中陰實，已陽不入陰，我心想，又一個化療後轉肝癌了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-kdugk8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-kdugk8b","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"餘症為：胃口正常，手溫足冷，一直覺得疲累，日便一次，但硬而排不盡感，氣味臭，夜尿一次，口不渴但覺得乾，常忘記喝水，口苦，舌麻，吃任何食物皆覺得酸，眼酸澀，晨起有黃痰，皮膚癢但無疹子，已服西藥干擾素數月。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-okr3t3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-okr3t3i","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：左關跗骨脈"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-u7m9hmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-u7m9hmb","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：苔薄白，尖紅，舌面兩側近邊緣處，各一長條青黑之色，邊有齒痕。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-ieikjf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-ieikjf9","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診：肝區破洞，有白點。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-064f3oj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-064f3oj","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：胸脅苦滿，心下痞，撫之脅下及胃脘寒，而臍周、下腹熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-atx5nqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-atx5nqp","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：肝家陰實，陽不入陰，厥陰證。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-ppqql15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-ppqql15","updated":"20240522092410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方：【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吳茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"湯合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴芩玉龍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師治肝要藥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）加青皮】"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-pbze75v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-pbze75v","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫囑：要求病人不作切片等侵入性檢查，病人同意，但病人不敢停止干擾素，因其西醫告訴她，如停藥，肝將惡化。我回她道：「若有效，為何肝區如此疼痛？妳又何需來找我們治療？」。病人久久不語，我說：這樣吧，如果中醫治療有進步，請妳停止一切西藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-4a20gkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-4a20gkh","updated":"20240522092400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"難怪"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師常言治病容易，治心難，不僅要啟蒙，往往要擊蒙啊！"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-e9w960y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-e9w960y","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎9-23-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-vcqvts5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-vcqvts5","updated":"20240522092354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    藥後唇舌微麻"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（漢唐生附二錢，藥力已夠）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，足溫，盜汗大為減少，半夜3-4點醒，口苦減少，日便一次，硬且不易出，有排氣，眼睛累，天亮時頭微痛，但右脅痛毫無改善，側睡則右肋痛，故只能平躺睡，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"開刀、化療或切片的痛皆不易治"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師總苦口婆心，好說歹說，怒斥疾言，奉勸大家不要如此作"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-l3rwere","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-l3rwere","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：胸脅苦滿，右脅下壓痛劇烈，天樞穴也有壓痛，叩診有鼓音。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-g2tkmw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-g2tkmw4","updated":"20240522092348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方：【大柴胡湯加元胡、川楝子（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師言此藥對為治癌痛要藥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）、旋覆花、香附】三日份。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心想若不效，則下甘遂半夏湯。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-yz8w6ak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-yz8w6ak","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎9-23-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-n8yrhs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-n8yrhs6","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脅痛加劇，大便細而不暢，不能側睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-b313qhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-b313qhx","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能再猶豫，處方：【甘遂半夏湯】一煎劑（生甘遂6克、生半夏15克、白芍10克、炙甘草15克、六碗煮兩碗，去藥渣後加蜜2盎司再煮10分鐘）空腹服第一碗，若不應，半日許再服第二碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-kss2y10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-kss2y10","updated":"20240522092340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癌症腫瘤，引起之脅下痛，往住是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肋膜間堆積寒水不去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，壓力增加而造成痛劇難癒，病人体強則強攻一劑甘遂半夏湯去其水飲而後補氣血，若體不甚強，又不得不攻，于甘遂半夏湯煎劑中用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小量甘遂（不超過３克）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配以補劑、附子連續緩攻一星期，往往有一定效果。跟診中即常見"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師擅用此方治脅下痛，尤其右脅。肝腹水難消時，于補氣治濕湯中運用此法也能建奇功。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-q94p0pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-q94p0pa","updated":"20240522092121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人回覆，第一碗不應，第二碗服後30分鐘內共吐１次，拉２次。右肋痛減輕，但左脅痛感反而較清晰"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（並非左脅加劇，而是右脅痛減輕後較以往容易察覺到罷了。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃酸，足麻，體力大減，覺得很累。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-n5eyee8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-n5eyee8","updated":"20240522092328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方：【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"八珍湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆代赭湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師言此方擅治左脅痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"代赭石20克攻堅通便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）、合肝著"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、炮附、柴芩玉龍、大黃3克"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"使邪有通路"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"】考旋覆花湯中之茜草，即為倪師治肝活肝血喜用之藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-y7shy44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-y7shy44","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   10-3-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-vlktx5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-vlktx5n","updated":"20240522092143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右脅痛輕，左脅偶有針刺感，便暢每日兩次，近已有兩日半夜不再醒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（陰實己打開）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-nqj5pas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-nqj5pas","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"效不更方，"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-8vzillm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-8vzillm","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   10-17-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-xfj5lk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-xfj5lk3","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病情略有反覆，右脅雖已不痛，但仍脹滿不舒，左脅偶有刺感，口不渴，忘記喝水，睡眠又變差，多夢，常在半夜３點醒，晨起有盜汗，自覺足腫，日便一次，排氣有，但已不臭，胃口好，足有時冷，較多時後溫。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-iyulmnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-iyulmnh","updated":"20240522092302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   10-17-08至11-4-08期間以【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3-6克)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆代赭湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴芩玉龍，生附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及活血、補腎之品，化裁加減】生甘遂，每服三日，停三日，足冷明顯則配以生附。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-t13wpvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-t13wpvn","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   11-4-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-cm928hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-cm928hk","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐過兩次，排出黑色或綠色的臭便，昨日開始轉黃色便，味較以前不臭，７天中有１-2日便祕，口中酸味大減，睡眠品質不佳，但不至於固定時間醒，有時因脅痛而醒，晨起盜汗已改善，身無燥熱，皮膚癢減輕，但右脅間斷性脹痛感始終未能盡除，每日約有十餘次脹痛。查其脈弦微緊，腹診仍有右脅苦滿，深按則痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-zz4rn2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-zz4rn2y","updated":"20240522092243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記起昨夜，翻閱金匱，有一條文始終未吃透，第十篇：『脅下偏痛，發熱，其脈緊弦，此寒也，以溫藥下之，宜"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黃附子湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。』"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮附、細辛、大黃】"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"決定一試，以盡除脅下寒水。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-carulne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-carulne","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   11-7-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-ih09432","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-ih09432","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不料效果奇佳，排便正常，日兩次，暢快，有一日又排出綠便，右脅痛次數減為每日四到五次，左脅一次，末稍神經痛也減少。病人同意停服干擾素。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-09vgmwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-09vgmwg","updated":"20240522092238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方：【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黃附子湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴芩玉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，青皮、三稜莪朮，歸芎芍、丹皮等破血補血之品。】"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"其中炮附，來源為漢唐生附，自己家中烤箱，烤成炮附，避免膽巴毒性。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-ks364fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-ks364fc","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎   11-14-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-vx5ugja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-vx5ugja","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者自訴，這是自從化療以來，唯一沒有疼痛，且天天一覺到天亮的一星期，精神体力大好。西醫查肝功能，目前正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-61blwxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-61blwxj","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生孟超報告到此11-27-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-rr6rujr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-rr6rujr","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此刻正值感恩節，感謝恩師惇惇教悔。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-zmj7oi5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-zmj7oi5","updated":"20240522092012"}},{"ID":"20240522092012-favx0hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-favx0hu","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※附相關條文，以利名位師兄檢索。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-ntnihew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-ntnihew","updated":"20240522092220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、脅下偏痛，發熱，其脈緊弦，此寒也，以溫藥下之，宜"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黃附子湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮附、細辛、大黃】"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-mhd7879","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-mhd7879","updated":"20240522092222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、傷寒發汗，若吐，若下，解後，心下痞硬，噫氣不除者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆代赭湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-64zauae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-64zauae","updated":"20240522092225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、肝著，其人常欲蹈其胸上，先未苦時，但欲飲熱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"【旋覆花、茜草、蔥白】"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-0sqx9em","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-0sqx9em","updated":"20240522092226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、.病者脈伏，其人欲自利，利反快，雖利，心下續堅滿，此為留飲去故也，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂半夏湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（甘遂湯劑遠弱於生用之粉劑，不可以道理計"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師有時改為粉劑生用峻下逐水）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-de7hvxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-de7hvxx","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（留飲）："}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-1475zs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-1475zs0","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"∆夫心下有留飲，其人背寒，冷如掌大。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-8jurrdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-8jurrdy","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"∆留飲者，脅下痛引缺盆，咳嗽則輒已。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-xbbcw38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-xbbcw38","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"∆胸中有留飲，其人短氣而渴，四肢歷節痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-z8njg0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-z8njg0j","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"∆脈沈者有留飲。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-yjbq6yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-yjbq6yj","updated":"20240522092212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-vfc6nnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-vfc6nnu","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  孟超非常優秀，真正是做到一位正統經方家的能力，我漢唐醫學得此傳人，正代表著經方的再次傳世必然成功，世間的西醫學本就是錯誤的醫學，還好有中醫學存在，但是中醫學卻出現個溫病學說，將真正中醫學引導到錯誤的途徑上，使得世界醫學史更是雪上加霜，世間醫師何其無辜，許多優秀的知識分子，耗費其一生的精力，來研究醫學，真正是想為世人解決來自疾病的威脅，但是很可惜的是，被西藥廠引導到錯誤的研究途徑上，我ㄧ直在強調，我只是一位非常平凡的人，並無大智慧，只是我學到的是正確的醫學，所以我很強，希望各位醫學同道們都能多多研究經方學，這種絕對醫學已經不需要做大幅度的刪改與增修，只要安步就般的按照經方法則來做，就可以治好病了，希望世上所有醫師有如孟超般的慧心，才能真正解救病人於水火之中。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-mbf2n6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-mbf2n6i","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    孟超，請繼續加油，希望你將來能接替老師的責任，繼續薪火相傳的將經方傳播給下一代，這可能是我們師徒千年來的宿命吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092012-zzwkbhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092012-zzwkbhp","updated":"20240522092012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]}]}